    "body": "I notice one related point in the DOM features section. PI interface and PI target are listed separatedly, while other interfaces are on the same bullet point. Shall I combine them?\r\n\r\n> - [Document](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-document) interface and its [doctype](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-doctype) attribute\r\n> - [ProcessingInstruction](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-processinginstruction) interface\r\n> - …\r\n> - [processing instruction target](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-processinginstruction-target)\r\n\r\nThis could be:\r\n\r\n- [ProcessingInstruction](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-processinginstruction) interface and its [target](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-processinginstruction-target) attribute",
    "created_at": "2026-07-08T14:55:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-08T14:55:14Z",
